{
	chapter.15A3DF849B02E355.title: "Tips and Tricks"
	chapter.3A4C355C56DF96B7.title: "Johns First Day"
	chapter.406FBC6C5D04CAF0.title: "And So, It Begins"
	quest.0256EBCB0E9CD4B8.quest_desc: ["1k drives are small but 5 of them should last you for a while! "]
	quest.0256EBCB0E9CD4B8.quest_subtitle: "1k is small, but we can make it work. "
	quest.0298669E0D976BE2.quest_desc: ["You can make a wooden pick but I think that is dumb so ill just give you a stone one instead. You are welcome! "]
	quest.0298669E0D976BE2.quest_subtitle: "Wood picks are dumb..."
	quest.0634838CC8F751A3.quest_desc: ["You need to send two copper ingots through the middle with redstone on the left. Then to power the machine add more redstone to the right side."]
	quest.0634838CC8F751A3.quest_subtitle: "Your first machine! "
	quest.0726D7A39C6872A1.quest_desc: ["This is Johns choice for early game power. He knows that there are better options. He likes this one because it is simple. "]
	quest.0726D7A39C6872A1.quest_subtitle: "You do one. I give you one."
	quest.0726D7A39C6872A1.title: "Early Game Power"
	quest.07CD22762BC18C31.quest_desc: ["If you want to create a team for you and your friends, use the command &a/ftbteams party create (name of team)&r to create the team!"]
	quest.09484CF47CE39B24.quest_desc: [
		"To claim chunks, open up your map using &6M&r, then click the &aClaimed Chunks&r icon in the top left."
		""
		"To claim a chunk, left click and drag to claim."
		""
		"To force load a chunk, shift-left click the chunk. If done properly, you'll see lines across the chunk."
	]
	quest.0A2B1579701DA373.quest_desc: [
		"Add redstone and glowstone to the covered cable and you get smart cables!  I like these because it has a visual on the cable for how many channels are currently being used by it. "
		""
		"These still just carry 8 channels. "
	]
	quest.0A2B1579701DA373.quest_subtitle: "You can see the channels! "
	quest.0CBDC97A52BF6C5C.quest_desc: ["The Inscriber is used to make all of the processors that you will need to store items. "]
	quest.0CBDC97A52BF6C5C.quest_subtitle: "Create Computer Chips"
	quest.11A76C537F88E544.quest_desc: ["Okay so you now have a diamond pick. Next youll need to prep going to the nether. You dont need a lot while you are there, but  you will need some Nether Quartz and Glowstone Dust for your ME system. "]
	quest.11A76C537F88E544.quest_subtitle: "Okay you rich now! "
	quest.11E6079C5A2CD951.quest_desc: ["Go punch a tree and use Ultimine. By default that keybind is set to Left Control. "]
	quest.11E6079C5A2CD951.quest_subtitle: "How every pack starts..."
	quest.13C19EA081CFBB84.quest_desc: ["Smelt the quartz blend to get some silicon. This will be needed for each processor that you make. "]
	quest.13C19EA081CFBB84.quest_subtitle: "Smart sand? "
	quest.1C11D19BC4932B9F.quest_desc: [
		"Hello, friend, and welcome to JohnHall CEu!"
		""
		"This modpack is designed to challenge the player through various means, especially harder recipes. I advice that you automate crafting of as much as possible, as early as possible. Things are going to get complicated."
		""
		"You don't need to keep this book. Even if you don't have the item, you can press Tilde (~) to view it at any time...unless you decided to change the keybind."
		""
		"If you play through a launcher that relies on &6Curse&r&0Forge&r, be aware that it doesn't always work properly. It doesn't play well with all the custom recipes and tweaks that this pack has. So if you have any problems, first switch to another launcher like Prism."
		""
		"I don't want to overload you with knowledge, so important info will become available through checkbox quests and subtitles when it's needed. If you feel like something is wrong, let us know on discord!"
		""
		"Check the checkbox to get your starterkit."
		""
		"I suggest you make a Backpack out of the Leather and String."
		""
		"Good luck!"
	]
	quest.1C11D19BC4932B9F.title: "&dWelcome to JohnHall CEu!"
	quest.1E5252052A08BE0F.quest_desc: [
		"Place these Budding Certus Quartz blocks down up one block from the ground and with a free space on each side of each one. This will allow them to grow more crystals. "
		""
		"Once they die and are no longer producing they wwill switch to a solid block of certus quartz. break the extra buds before you break the block to get a little extra dust. "
	]
	quest.1E5252052A08BE0F.quest_subtitle: "Put it on the ground."
	quest.2FCC69F5630F4F06.quest_desc: ["The ME controller is the brain of your storage system. Make sure that you connect all the parts to this guy. "]
	quest.2FCC69F5630F4F06.quest_subtitle: "BRAINS!!!"
	quest.377A85D5D76180A2.quest_desc: ["You can add Certus Quartz to the inscriber to make Certuz Dust."]
	quest.377A85D5D76180A2.quest_subtitle: "You can also use a Mekanism Crusher for Certus Dust"
	quest.38D3A4F99A3FAA33.quest_desc: ["Mekanism is not one of my favorite mods... But for early game power it is super simple and easy to get in to. These are the basic resources that you will need."]
	quest.38D3A4F99A3FAA33.quest_subtitle: "Do some stuff. Get some things."
	quest.38D3A4F99A3FAA33.title: "Go Mining! "
	quest.3A6760826D8BA66A.quest_desc: ["You only one of these for the Crafting Terminal. So obv ill give you an extra. "]
	quest.3A6760826D8BA66A.quest_subtitle: "You only need one."
	quest.3BB5BBD42587C640.quest_desc: ["5 1K Drives will store a ton of stuff. So ill give you 5 more just to make it last a while longer! "]
	quest.3BB5BBD42587C640.quest_subtitle: "You make 5 and ill give you another 5!"
	quest.3BB5BBD42587C640.title: "Storage space! "
	quest.3DCCF7C1B8E7BA5D.quest_desc: ["This terminal is AWESOME! It allows you to craft using the items from your ME system directly! "]
	quest.3DCCF7C1B8E7BA5D.quest_subtitle: "Crafting from your storage."
	quest.3E13A38644D25DE5.quest_desc: ["You will need two Engineering Processors to make the Me Drive which will store all of your Item Storage Cells."]
	quest.3E13A38644D25DE5.quest_subtitle: "You will also need these..."
	quest.3F4CB52E8FDED374.quest_desc: [
		"These fat boys are crafted by combining four of the other smart cables that you have made."
		""
		"These carry 32 Channels. You can do a LOT with 32 channels! "
	]
	quest.3F4CB52E8FDED374.quest_subtitle: "THICCCC Cables"
	quest.3F4E0178DB81CE3A.quest_desc: [
		"You will need three Logic processors for the Crafting Terminal."
		""
		"You will also want five of these to create five 1k Item Storage Cells."
	]
	quest.3F4E0178DB81CE3A.quest_subtitle: "You need these."
	quest.40B8090B139171AC.quest_desc: [
		"There are plenty of helpful commands within JHCEu. Here are a few:"
		""
		"&e/sethome&r (name of home) | Let's you set a home that you can teleport back to using /home (name). Example: /sethome farm - then teleport with /home farm."
		""
		"&e/spawn&r | This will teleport you to the spawn of your overworld."
		""
		"&e/rtp&r | 'Random Teleport' will teleport you to a random location in the world."
		""
		"Note: These commands have cooldowns and limits. If you'd like to change them, you can edit the config file which can be found here:"
		""
		"- For Singleplayer | &osaves/(name of save)/serverconfig/ftbessentials.snbt&r"
		""
		"- For Servers | &oworld/serverconfig/ftbessentials.snbt&r"
	]
	quest.4814CBAD7BAEAB76.quest_desc: ["Build a Charger. You need this to make Charged Certus and for turning a compas into a meteorite compass. "]
	quest.4814CBAD7BAEAB76.quest_subtitle: "Your first step into AE2!!"
	quest.52BA8487302353C4.quest_desc: ["I would highly suggest setting up some automation for certus as soon as you can. you will need a lot of it. "]
	quest.52BA8487302353C4.quest_subtitle: "We got the Smart Rocks"
	quest.55DB6D10C9D6D944.quest_desc: ["This is just a smart box. It it used for storing your Item Storage Cells. Right click and put them in! "]
	quest.55DB6D10C9D6D944.quest_subtitle: "Store the drives."
	quest.595F3C629886BCB4.quest_desc: ["Run in and find the closest source of Glowstone Dust and Nether Quartz."]
	quest.595F3C629886BCB4.quest_subtitle: "Yikes!"
	quest.59E0187C16FDFC3C.quest_desc: ["Make a crafting table on a stick and then assign a key to this. John uses \"C\", but you can use whatever you want! "]
	quest.59E0187C16FDFC3C.quest_subtitle: "So much better that a crafting table! "
	quest.5DBE7D6983D1DF03.quest_desc: ["So this guy has been a bit buggy for a while. NOTE: Follow the Compass in your hotbar NOT the one in your hand... Dont ask me why..."]
	quest.5DBE7D6983D1DF03.quest_subtitle: "Lead me to the Smart Rocks"
	quest.5F5A06F222D15786.quest_desc: [
		"In this modpack, quests are optional. Mods are not gated behind completing any quests!"
		""
		"A lot of the individual Questlines outside of the Main questline are meant to serve as mod guides. If you want to follow the progression, make sure to check out the Main Questline!"
	]
	quest.6404A64777203A61.quest_desc: ["Throw some of those Charged Certus Crystals into some water with Redstone and Nether Quartz."]
	quest.6404A64777203A61.quest_subtitle: "Purple Smart Rocks?"
	quest.65402EEB875CF8FB.quest_desc: ["By mixing one Certus Quartz Dust with two Coal and six Sand you can make a Quartz blend. This dramatically increases the output of your Quartz dust.  "]
	quest.65402EEB875CF8FB.quest_subtitle: "Increase the Output"
	quest.69E3D9310242010A.quest_desc: ["This is where you start! Keep in mind that this is a beginners guide for following along with John and his first day in most nodpacks. This is not the only way to start or even the best way. This is just how he does it! "]
	quest.69E3D9310242010A.quest_subtitle: "This is how John starts packs!"
	quest.72F55BB7F029B43C.quest_desc: ["You are going to need some glowstone and nether quartz... Go in. Get it. GET OUT."]
	quest.72F55BB7F029B43C.quest_subtitle: "Get in and out! "
	quest.72F55BB7F029B43C.title: "Steal the essentials and RUN"
	quest.74F854AFD7D6A9CF.quest_desc: ["These cables connect all of your AE2 things to eachother. Each one of these Fluix Glass Cables has 8 \"Channels\" meaning that they are only big enough to carry data to connect 8 different AE2 devices."]
	quest.74F854AFD7D6A9CF.quest_subtitle: "We can finally connect things! "
	quest.78776D5D61E2B29A.quest_desc: ["Smelt down some sky stone to get sky stone blocks. You need these for the ME controller. "]
	quest.78776D5D61E2B29A.quest_subtitle: "Put it in the fire! "
	quest.79ADBF45A0EEE52E.quest_desc: ["If you put one of the Certus Quartz Crystals into a Charger it will... Charge. You dont need a lot of these right now, but you will need some."]
	quest.79ADBF45A0EEE52E.quest_subtitle: "Energize the Smart Rocks"
	quest.7B21E57292A5E6D7.quest_desc: [
		"To make the two steel that you need you will need to use Coal on the left side of the Infuser with Iron in the middle. This will create enriched iron. Then take that enriched iron and put it in the middle with more coal on the left side to make steel dust."
		""
		"Then smelt the steel dust to get a steel ingot. You need two of these and a redstone to make your first cables! "
		""
		"These cables will be your best friend to get power from our first generator to the machines that you will have. "
	]
	quest.7B21E57292A5E6D7.quest_subtitle: "Move Dat Power! "
	quest.7D204BA8C61DE837.quest_desc: [
		"All you have to do is add wool to your Fluix Cables. These are the exact same as Fluix glass cables only you can color code them."
		""
		"I dont use these for anything. "
	]
	quest.7D204BA8C61DE837.quest_subtitle: "Cables get better!"
	quest.7F23A741EA7E14D7.quest_desc: ["One you have found the meteorite. You want to mine the some sky stone with a diamond pick and bring some back, then once you get to the middle you want to mine the partially grown certus buds first. Then break the center block to get the four presses. After all of that if you have Cardboard boxes you can use those, if not just break the Budding Certus Quartz blocks and bring them home!  "]
	quest.7F23A741EA7E14D7.quest_subtitle: "Cant be too smart. It fell from the sky..."
	quest.7F23A741EA7E14D7.title: "Go Find the Rock From the Sky!"
	quest.7F49261AA02859B3.quest_desc: ["You have an Iron pick! Do some basic mining. Go find a tunnel to get some basic resources. "]
	quest.7F49261AA02859B3.quest_subtitle: "Moving up in the world! "
